      "message": "docs: vendor-fixtures guide states the built-in vises as shipped\n\nThe guide said the built-in parametric vises were \"not merged yet\" (PR #802)\nand that grid-hole placement on fixture plates was \"planned\" (#819). PR #802\nand PR #823 are merged and #788 and #819 are closed, so both lines now state\nthem as shipped.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nFixes #1270",
